WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.192 --> 01:55.816
=Episode 3=

22
02:05.800 --> 02:06.520
It's Di Liren.

23
02:13.001 --> 02:14.160
What took you so long?

24
02:14.561 --> 02:15.320
Because it's you.

25
02:15.401 --> 02:16.361
I just freshened up.

26
02:20.160 --> 02:21.001
I still prefer you

27
02:21.001 --> 02:21.720
without makeup.

28
02:22.200 --> 02:23.121
I'll take it off now.

29
02:23.600 --> 02:24.320
So obedient, huh?

30
02:24.561 --> 02:26.401
I just want to keep you happy.

31
02:31.720 --> 02:32.880
Two cups of coffee?

32
02:36.401 --> 02:37.241
It's still warm.

33
02:39.961 --> 02:40.841
Someone just left?

34
02:41.920 --> 02:43.081
No.

35
02:44.521 --> 02:45.640
They're both mine.

36
02:46.200 --> 02:47.521
I just got a new coffee machine,

37
02:47.600 --> 02:47.961
so I can

38
02:47.961 --> 02:48.920
make coffee for you.

39
02:49.801 --> 02:51.440
I made too much

40
02:51.480 --> 02:52.401
on my first try,

41
02:52.880 --> 02:54.001
so I poured it all out.

42
02:54.961 --> 02:55.281
There is

43
02:55.281 --> 02:56.361
my lipstick on the rim.

44
02:57.760 --> 02:58.281
My bad.

45
02:58.920 --> 03:00.640
I'll reimburse you for the machine.

46
03:01.640 --> 03:03.521
That might be a bit tricky,

47
03:05.001 --> 03:05.920
because it was a gift.

48
03:10.401 --> 03:11.241
From a man?

49
03:12.081 --> 03:12.521
What?

50
03:13.801 --> 03:14.440
Are you jealous?

51
03:16.648 --> 03:20.072
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

52
03:22.152 --> 03:25.864
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

53
03:26.248 --> 03:28.936
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

54
03:28.936 --> 03:31.752
♪I fall into the abyss♪

55
03:38.984 --> 03:42.856
♪Shadows torn apart by moonlight♪

56
03:44.360 --> 03:48.328
♪Shards can't piece together tomorrow♪

57
03:48.328 --> 03:50.952
♪You set gentle traps♪

58
03:51.112 --> 03:53.800
♪Trapping me in place♪

59
04:02.281 --> 04:03.001
Honey,

60
04:05.920 --> 04:07.081
my period just started.

61
04:08.720 --> 04:09.841
It shouldn't be now.

62
04:12.801 --> 04:13.440
I've been

63
04:13.480 --> 04:14.640
stressed out from work.

64
04:15.241 --> 04:16.161
My cycle's messed up.

65
04:22.121 --> 04:23.080
Get some rest then.

66
04:23.121 --> 04:23.721
You're leaving?

67
04:24.280 --> 04:24.960
Back to work.

68
04:27.361 --> 04:28.481
I'll make it up to you,

69
04:28.481 --> 04:28.840
okay?

70
04:33.880 --> 04:34.241
I'm off.

71
04:37.992 --> 04:41.640
♪Cigarette glows like an epitaph♪

72
04:41.768 --> 04:43.880
♪The footnotes you left♪

73
04:44.488 --> 04:48.328
♪Are all plagiarized♪

74
04:55.721 --> 04:57.241
Wipe your mouth clean.

75
05:00.040 --> 05:03.624
♪Gaze colder than a blade♪

76
05:03.848 --> 05:06.440
♪I wipe away my tears♪

77
05:06.568 --> 05:11.784
♪And switch to a new soul♪

78
05:12.456 --> 05:14.888
♪I've seen this game before♪

79
05:15.176 --> 05:17.608
♪Every single move was calculated♪

80
05:19.280 --> 05:20.280
The CFO, right?

81
05:21.080 --> 05:21.960
Ready to work with me?

82
05:23.041 --> 05:24.041
Show me your sincerity.

83
05:26.216 --> 05:28.648
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

84
05:28.648 --> 05:30.760
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

85
05:32.552 --> 05:34.184
(Lanxu Hot Spring Hotel)

86
05:54.681 --> 05:55.121
Hello?

87
05:56.241 --> 05:57.280
I'm already downstairs.

88
06:02.481 --> 06:03.161
Honey,

89
06:03.520 --> 06:04.280
I'm so sorry.

90
06:04.801 --> 06:05.960
I have a business dinner

91
06:05.960 --> 06:06.561
to go.

92
06:07.001 --> 06:07.400
I have

93
06:07.400 --> 06:08.481
ordered dinner for you.

94
06:08.840 --> 06:09.601
My colleagues said

95
06:09.640 --> 06:10.880
this restaurant is amazing.

96
06:11.320 --> 06:11.960
Just stay home

97
06:12.080 --> 06:13.080
and wait for your food.

98
06:18.440 --> 06:19.561
(Di Liren)

99
06:19.561 --> 06:20.280
(Enjoy your meal.)

100
06:21.080 --> 06:22.241
He ordered dinner for you.

101
06:22.280 --> 06:22.880
Is that a way

102
06:22.921 --> 06:23.921
to check up on you?

103
06:24.241 --> 06:25.400
If no one signs for it,

104
06:25.400 --> 06:26.280
won't he get leery?

105
06:26.640 --> 06:27.001
Right.

106
06:30.361 --> 06:31.760
Hello, I have a delivery coming.

107
06:31.801 --> 06:33.161
(Property Management) Please accept it for me. Thanks.

108
06:56.840 --> 06:57.520
No rush.

109
07:12.121 --> 07:13.041
What?

110
07:14.241 --> 07:15.960
Afraid you can't resist my charm?

111
07:19.200 --> 07:20.080
Can't hold back?

112
07:20.520 --> 07:22.121
Aren't you more attracted to me?

113
07:22.801 --> 07:23.801
Acting tough won't help.

114
07:26.001 --> 07:26.880
It's soft here.

115
07:28.041 --> 07:29.280
Let me try it out.

116
07:31.320 --> 07:32.320
What's wrong?

117
07:33.200 --> 07:34.481
We haven't eaten yet.

118
07:35.280 --> 07:36.840
We have the whole night.

119
07:37.080 --> 07:37.681
No rush.

120
07:38.200 --> 07:39.200
Who's rushing?

121
07:42.840 --> 07:44.561
Let's make an exception tonight

122
07:44.760 --> 07:46.001
and eat at the restaurant.

123
07:46.520 --> 07:47.161
No.

124
07:47.681 --> 07:48.601
Someone might see us.

125
07:49.080 --> 07:50.200
We've only been out

126
07:50.241 --> 07:51.760
on one date the entire month.

127
07:52.840 --> 07:54.400
Being cooped up in the room every time,

128
07:55.681 --> 07:57.481
how is this any different from being at home?

129
07:59.400 --> 08:00.801
Didn't I compromise

130
08:00.840 --> 08:02.140
and take you to the hot springs?

131
08:05.561 --> 08:06.801
If you want to dine out,

132
08:07.280 --> 08:07.840
fine.

133
08:08.960 --> 08:09.561
You go,

134
08:10.121 --> 08:10.721
and I leave.

135
08:11.640 --> 08:12.400
Fine.

136
08:18.921 --> 08:19.760
Whatever you say.

137
08:21.121 --> 08:22.001
You order dinner.

138
08:22.440 --> 08:23.320
I'm taking a shower.

139
08:24.721 --> 08:25.760
Or

140
08:29.721 --> 08:30.801
want to join me?

141
08:33.481 --> 08:34.121
Sure.

142
08:35.321 --> 08:36.001
You go ahead.

143
08:36.481 --> 08:37.241
I'll be there soon.

144
08:39.121 --> 08:39.880
Come quickly.

145
08:54.081 --> 08:54.441
(Yu Meng) Come.

146
10:02.841 --> 10:03.400
Honey.

147
10:04.400 --> 10:04.961
Listen to me.

148
10:04.961 --> 10:05.481
Shut up!

149
10:05.841 --> 10:07.280
Now you listen to me.

150
10:07.680 --> 10:08.640
Put your clothes on.

151
10:08.961 --> 10:09.841
Go get a divorce now.

152
10:10.961 --> 10:11.321
I...

153
10:30.841 --> 10:31.201
Di...

154
10:31.880 --> 10:32.441
Mrs. Di?

155
10:32.800 --> 10:33.520
Why did you come?

156
10:48.520 --> 10:49.160
Zhang Tao?

157
10:49.800 --> 10:50.520
Why is it you...

158
10:53.441 --> 10:54.280
Why are you here?

159
10:54.760 --> 10:56.201
Mr. Di is meeting with clients.

160
10:56.441 --> 10:57.520
Wen Xiaoxiao and I are

161
10:57.560 --> 10:58.280
on standby here.

162
10:58.961 --> 11:00.001
Liren

163
11:00.321 --> 11:01.280
never came here at all?

164
11:02.160 --> 11:02.800
No.

165
11:05.441 --> 11:05.961
Liu Zi.

166
11:08.241 --> 11:09.001
Honey,

167
11:09.121 --> 11:09.880
why are you here?

168
11:12.040 --> 11:12.920
Honey,

169
11:13.680 --> 11:14.841
I was going to the hot spring

170
11:14.880 --> 11:15.640
with Zi

171
11:15.640 --> 11:16.481
and a few friends.

172
11:16.841 --> 11:18.241
A friend of mine said she saw you

173
11:18.481 --> 11:19.560
coming into this room,

174
11:19.841 --> 11:21.001
so I came over to check.

175
11:22.400 --> 11:23.601
She must have been mistaken.

176
11:24.280 --> 11:25.640
I was just talking with clients,

177
11:25.961 --> 11:27.081
all guys.

178
11:27.241 --> 11:27.920
We just finished.

179
11:31.081 --> 11:31.880
Then why did you

180
11:32.040 --> 11:33.040
show up here so suddenly?

181
11:33.121 --> 11:34.520
Mr. Di just finished

182
11:34.520 --> 11:35.875
and asked me to drive him home.

183
11:36.001 --> 11:37.201
When I told him you were here,

184
11:37.481 --> 11:38.441
he came right up.

185
11:43.201 --> 11:43.841
See?

186
11:44.081 --> 11:45.081
I told you.

187
11:45.321 --> 11:46.880
Liren would never fool around.

188
11:47.040 --> 11:48.721
Yet you insisted on coming up here.

189
11:49.001 --> 11:50.001
Look how awkward it is.

190
11:50.241 --> 11:50.841
Yeah.

191
11:51.121 --> 11:52.640
She described the guy just like you

192
11:52.680 --> 11:53.721
and sounded so sure.

193
11:54.201 --> 11:55.201
Meng was put on the spot,

194
11:55.241 --> 11:56.160
so she dragged me here

195
11:56.201 --> 11:57.160
to prove her wrong

196
11:57.201 --> 11:57.961
and shut her up.

197
11:59.280 --> 12:00.601
Your friend

198
12:00.640 --> 12:01.361
made a mistake.

199
12:02.800 --> 12:03.321
Honey,

200
12:03.680 --> 12:04.601
Zi and I

201
12:04.760 --> 12:05.880
are going to the hot spring.

202
12:06.081 --> 12:07.241
If you're done,

203
12:07.280 --> 12:08.040
go home first.

204
12:09.040 --> 12:09.520
All right.

205
12:10.680 --> 12:12.201
I'll have Zhang Tao stay to drive you.

206
12:12.441 --> 12:12.880
No need.

207
12:12.961 --> 12:13.640
I drove here.

208
12:13.880 --> 12:14.481
I'll make sure

209
12:14.481 --> 12:15.361
Meng gets home safely.

210
12:16.241 --> 12:17.321
Don't worry, honey.

211
12:17.880 --> 12:18.280
Okay.

212
12:18.481 --> 12:19.400
I trust you.

213
12:28.280 --> 12:29.081
What happened?

214
12:30.081 --> 12:30.841
Let's head out.

215
12:31.321 --> 12:32.481
What exactly happened?

216
12:32.680 --> 12:33.601
I'm not sure either.

217
12:33.841 --> 12:34.721
Di Liren definitely

218
12:34.760 --> 12:35.880
sensed something was off

219
12:36.241 --> 12:36.986
and pulled

220
12:36.986 --> 12:37.991
a bait-and-switch on me.

221
12:38.640 --> 12:39.361
How did he know

222
12:39.400 --> 12:40.160
you were coming?

223
12:40.841 --> 12:41.961
Did someone tip him off?

224
12:43.841 --> 12:45.081
He knows this hotel well.

225
12:45.400 --> 12:46.201
He definitely

226
12:46.201 --> 12:47.481
got Zhang Tao to keep watch.

227
12:49.201 --> 12:50.560
Either way, our cover is blown.

228
12:51.201 --> 12:51.920
From now on,

229
12:51.961 --> 12:53.040
he'll get more cautious.

230
12:53.640 --> 12:54.520
Gathering evidence

231
12:54.640 --> 12:55.481
will be even harder.

232
12:56.001 --> 12:57.121
He's extremely guarded.

233
12:57.520 --> 12:59.201
He only meets me in hotels he knows well

234
12:59.361 --> 13:00.601
or in my place.

235
13:01.241 --> 13:01.760
He even

236
13:01.800 --> 13:02.680
checks my phone

237
13:02.760 --> 13:04.160
to rule out any active recordings.

238
13:06.280 --> 13:07.081
How about

239
13:08.241 --> 13:10.321
we put a hidden camera in my place?

240
13:11.400 --> 13:12.081
That won't work.

241
13:12.601 --> 13:13.520
My lawyer said

242
13:13.841 --> 13:14.481
it is

243
13:14.481 --> 13:15.441
a serious violation

244
13:15.481 --> 13:16.321
of personal privacy.

245
13:16.400 --> 13:17.441
That's a legal risk.

246
13:17.560 --> 13:18.920
Besides, evidence like that

247
13:19.241 --> 13:20.321
might not even

248
13:20.481 --> 13:21.721
be admissible in court.

249
13:22.160 --> 13:23.481
It's better not to take the risk.

250
13:24.880 --> 13:25.880
What do we do now?

251
13:27.601 --> 13:28.800
For now,

252
13:29.400 --> 13:30.760
we have to keep playing along.

253
13:31.321 --> 13:32.321
As long as he sees you,

254
13:32.680 --> 13:33.640
we still have a chance.

255
13:38.241 --> 13:38.880
Wen Xiaoxiao,

256
13:39.201 --> 13:40.640
if you really had no intention

257
13:41.040 --> 13:42.241
of taking my place,

258
13:43.001 --> 13:44.280
why did you send me that photo?

259
13:44.680 --> 13:45.441
What photo?

260
13:46.241 --> 13:47.880
On our wedding anniversary,

261
13:48.001 --> 13:49.081
he sent me a bouquet

262
13:49.361 --> 13:50.560
with a photo inside.

263
13:51.001 --> 13:52.601
That's when

264
13:52.880 --> 13:54.040
I suspected he was cheating.

265
13:54.121 --> 13:55.040
Didn't you send it?

266
13:56.280 --> 13:57.160
I really have no idea.

267
13:57.721 --> 13:59.081
My position is hardly respectable.

268
13:59.640 --> 14:00.721
If exposed,

269
14:01.121 --> 14:02.081
it would backfire on me.

270
14:03.361 --> 14:04.880
Why would I ever send you the photo?

271
14:08.601 --> 14:10.001
Then there's only one explanation.

272
14:11.841 --> 14:12.841
Besides me,

273
14:14.001 --> 14:14.916
there's another lover.

274
14:17.481 --> 14:18.361
Another lover?

275
14:19.201 --> 14:19.721
Who is she?

276
14:20.001 --> 14:20.640
I don't know.

277
14:21.961 --> 14:23.961
But whoever put the photo in the flowers

278
14:24.400 --> 14:25.400
wasn't Wen Xiaoxiao.

279
14:25.481 --> 14:26.081
She said that?

280
14:26.880 --> 14:27.520
Are you sure

281
14:27.520 --> 14:28.361
she didn't lie?

282
14:28.640 --> 14:29.601
Lying to me now

283
14:29.640 --> 14:30.920
does her no good.

284
14:31.241 --> 14:32.441
Di Liren

285
14:33.280 --> 14:34.321
is so busy at work,

286
14:34.520 --> 14:36.121
yet now another side chick pops up?

287
14:36.920 --> 14:37.920
That punk

288
14:39.560 --> 14:41.400
is juggling this many women.

289
14:44.321 --> 14:45.160
It seems you still

290
14:45.201 --> 14:46.160
don't know men well.

291
14:46.361 --> 14:46.841
No one

292
14:46.841 --> 14:48.560
cheats just once.

293
14:48.841 --> 14:50.081
Once a man discovers pi,

294
14:50.121 --> 14:51.121
he doesn't stop at three.

295
14:51.400 --> 14:52.841
There's an infinite string

296
14:52.880 --> 14:54.201
of decimal points right after it.

297
14:54.640 --> 14:55.601
Is it done yet?

298
14:55.760 --> 14:57.081
Seriously? You're crying?

299
14:57.321 --> 14:58.841
I faint at the sight of blood.

300
14:59.001 --> 14:59.680
All right, done.

301
15:00.160 --> 15:01.081
I can't believe,

302
15:01.121 --> 15:01.920
in this case,

303
15:01.961 --> 15:03.361
you rushed to get a checkup

304
15:03.680 --> 15:05.121
instead of catching him cheating.

305
15:05.601 --> 15:06.560
Of course.

306
15:07.001 --> 15:08.280
I fear he might give me an STD.

307
15:13.241 --> 15:14.481
Let's look at this another way.

308
15:14.640 --> 15:16.121
Let's say the other woman does exist,

309
15:16.160 --> 15:17.081
but she and Di Liren

310
15:17.121 --> 15:18.201
aren't hooking up.

311
15:19.241 --> 15:20.201
I have no clue.

312
15:20.520 --> 15:21.441
Our only lead right now

313
15:21.441 --> 15:22.280
is the flower shop.

314
15:22.280 --> 15:23.040
Do you know where

315
15:23.040 --> 15:23.760
he ordered the flowers?

316
15:23.800 --> 15:24.920
Are you going home today?

317
15:25.001 --> 15:25.520
Going back

318
15:25.560 --> 15:26.468
to dig up more info.

319
15:26.468 --> 15:27.120
What if Di Liren

320
15:27.120 --> 15:28.560
has already noticed something?

321
15:30.775 --> 15:31.556
(Husband) Di Liren.

322
15:35.001 --> 15:35.520
I don't know.

323
15:35.520 --> 15:36.361
I know nothing.

324
15:36.601 --> 15:37.880
I don't know where he got them.

325
15:37.961 --> 15:38.680
All I know now is

326
15:38.721 --> 15:39.481
that looking at him

327
15:39.481 --> 15:40.680
makes me sick to my stomach.

328
15:43.201 --> 15:44.520
I need some quiet time alone.

329
16:13.760 --> 16:14.601
(You suffered a lot)

330
16:14.640 --> 16:15.721
(just to get pregnant)

331
16:15.760 --> 16:16.841
(with his child.)

332
16:16.961 --> 16:18.520
(The pills and the injections you took)

333
16:18.601 --> 16:20.084
(could fill an entire cart.)

334
16:20.084 --> 16:20.804
(You even gave up)

335
16:20.804 --> 16:21.880
(your favorite ice cream.)

336
16:22.121 --> 16:22.880
(Why should you?)

337
16:28.201 --> 16:29.880
(Today, I totally realize)

338
16:30.640 --> 16:31.721
(that my feelings for him,)

339
16:32.321 --> 16:33.201
(just like ice cream,)

340
16:33.920 --> 16:35.160
(have completely melted away.)

341
16:36.560 --> 16:38.280
(Thinking about our sugar-coated marriage)

342
16:38.800 --> 16:40.321
(that was laced with arsenic,)

343
16:41.321 --> 16:43.520
(I only feel pure physical revulsion.)

344
16:44.880 --> 16:46.201
(Yet I still have to stand it)

345
16:47.201 --> 16:48.121
(and play along.)

346
16:54.961 --> 16:56.280
Stylist Number 88,

347
16:56.400 --> 16:57.800
