348
17:12.120 --> 17:13.401
Is the temperature okay for you?

349
17:14.760 --> 17:15.280
Honey,

350
17:15.360 --> 17:16.001
do you remember?

351
17:16.760 --> 17:17.921
The year we just got married,

352
17:18.600 --> 17:19.881
you couldn't sleep one night

353
17:20.600 --> 17:21.481
and took me downstairs

354
17:22.040 --> 17:23.401
to sneak into Dad's wine cabinet.

355
17:23.401 --> 17:24.170
We stole a bottle.

356
17:24.401 --> 17:25.760
You said 1988

357
17:25.881 --> 17:26.641
