362
17:33.800 --> 17:34.760
I searched everywhere

363
17:34.881 --> 17:36.401
and paid a fortune for a replacement

364
17:36.721 --> 17:38.241
from the same vintage and vineyard.

365
17:39.481 --> 17:40.641
Yet when we put it back,

366
17:40.800 --> 17:41.441
Dad said

367
17:41.921 --> 17:42.800
