368
17:46.881 --> 17:47.560
I don't remember.

369
17:48.320 --> 17:49.161
I forgot long ago.

370
17:49.360 --> 17:50.481
You talk too much.

371
18:05.120 --> 18:05.760
Honey,

372
18:06.280 --> 18:07.441
are you still mad at me?

373
18:07.679 --> 18:09.624
I told you, it was just a misunderstanding today.

374
18:11.401 --> 18:12.161
I promise,

375
18:12.840 --> 18:14.280
