376
18:14.961 --> 18:16.241
I'll let you know in advance.

377
18:16.401 --> 18:16.961
All right?

378
18:18.441 --> 18:18.901
By the way,

379
18:19.520 --> 18:20.280
why did you

380
18:20.280 --> 18:20.961
