464
21:06.080 --> 21:06.840
Like

465
21:07.360 --> 21:08.560
photos of Mr. Di and me.

466
21:10.641 --> 21:12.080
So I guess

467
21:12.320 --> 21:13.120
this person

468
21:13.520 --> 21:14.280
doesn't know

469
21:14.320 --> 21:15.479
