518
23:05.401 --> 23:06.401
What happened?

519
23:07.401 --> 23:08.401
The company needed funds,

520
23:08.441 --> 23:09.241
so I put it all in.

521
23:11.840 --> 23:12.760
You used family funds

522
23:12.760 --> 23:13.721
without even telling me,

523
23:13.760 --> 23:14.201
