524
23:15.040 --> 23:15.441
Honey,

525
23:16.040 --> 23:16.840
don't be mad.

526
23:17.001 --> 23:17.721
Premium amount?

527
23:17.760 --> 23:18.520
I'll give you now.

528
23:19.201 --> 23:19.840
No need.

529
23:20.201 --> 23:20.760
I have money.

530
23:30.420 --> 23:30.824
(Jiao Xu)

531
23:30.840 --> 23:31.481
(Where are you?)

532
23:31.840 --> 23:32.681
(We need to talk.)

533
23:35.560 --> 23:37.080
- Stop! Don't run! - Stop!

534
23:37.280 --> 23:39.360
- Stop! - Stop right there!

535
23:39.401 --> 23:40.040
Stop!

536
23:40.280 --> 23:41.001
Drive!

537
23:41.120 --> 23:41.840
Go!

538
23:42.401 --> 23:43.800
- Stop! - Stop! Get out of the car!

539
23:44.401 --> 23:45.520
- Stop! - Stop!

540
23:47.721 --> 23:48.481
What's going on?

541
23:49.080 --> 23:50.201
Why are they chasing you?

542
23:51.560 --> 23:52.840
When you called me,

543
23:53.120 --> 23:54.441
I had just won a divorce case

544
23:55.120 --> 23:56.360
