545
23:56.401 --> 23:58.040
The husband was left with nothing.

546
23:58.481 --> 24:00.080
He was furious

547
24:00.760 --> 24:02.201
and intended to waylay me out there.

548
24:04.641 --> 24:05.040
Who knew

549
24:05.040 --> 24:06.560
you could sprint so fast

550
24:06.840 --> 24:07.881
in dress shoes?

551
24:09.401 --> 24:10.441
I usually pair

552
24:10.600 --> 24:12.201
a suit with sneakers for court.

553
24:12.560 --> 24:13.201
Rule of thumb.

554
24:13.481 --> 24:14.600
With a windbreaker.

555
24:14.721 --> 24:15.721
If they catch up,

556
24:15.840 --> 24:17.080
I slip out of my jacket easily.

557
24:17.120 --> 24:18.201
They can't grab me at all.

558
24:19.881 --> 24:20.600
Turns out

559
24:20.641 --> 24:21.881
