560
24:26.016 --> 24:26.921
They're catching up!

561
24:26.921 --> 24:27.681
Step on it! Go!

562
24:28.760 --> 24:29.481
Hit the gas!

563
24:29.760 --> 24:30.641
I'm doing it!

564
24:31.401 --> 24:32.481
Turn right!

565
24:36.840 --> 24:37.921
Don't slow down!

566
24:38.120 --> 24:39.161
Don't you see the car?

567
24:39.241 --> 24:40.360
