568
24:48.161 --> 24:48.600
I'm sorry.

569
24:48.641 --> 24:49.241
I'm so sorry.

570
24:49.681 --> 24:50.320
Wait a moment.

571
24:56.808 --> 24:59.464
(Di Liren)

572
25:01.681 --> 25:02.840
You need any help?

573
25:03.560 --> 25:05.241
