597
25:41.481 --> 25:42.001
Take photos.

598
25:45.360 --> 25:46.001
Wait a second.

599
25:48.800 --> 25:49.241
You...

600
25:53.040 --> 25:53.481
Done.

601
25:54.721 --> 25:56.600
