658
27:32.520 --> 27:33.360
So,

659
27:34.520 --> 27:35.161
I suspect...

660
27:35.161 --> 27:36.120
In my experience,

661
27:36.600 --> 27:37.201
he's

662
27:37.721 --> 27:38.760
- transferring assets. - Transferring assets.

663
27:40.320 --> 27:41.001
What should I do?

664
27:41.800 --> 27:42.721
If you want a strategy,

665
27:42.840 --> 27:43.441
