728
29:14.280 --> 29:15.320
Debts?

729
29:16.001 --> 29:16.401
Yes.

730
29:24.840 --> 29:25.760
Since Di Liren

731
29:25.840 --> 29:26.921
sold off all the funds

732
29:27.001 --> 29:27.681
